  "id": "FA3-DEC-HARDWARE-AGNOSTIC-CORE-2026-09-15",
  "title": "FA3 core has no mandatory hardware",
  "date": "2026-09-15",
  "status": "CANONICAL",
  "priority": "P0",
  "decision": "FA3 core SHALL define no global CPU, accelerator, vendor, SKU, VRAM, CUDA compute-capability, topology, device-count, or reference-host hardware minimum. Hardware is discovered at runtime; resource requirements belong exclusively to individual workloads/providers and are admitted by the Host Resource Broker.",
